        What drives us
      </h2>
    </div>

    {# Single divided band (FAQ's divide-y recipe) instead of four repeated
       icon tiles — reads as one confident element, not a lazy grid. #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 divide-y divide-navy-100 rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white shadow-subtle sm:grid-cols-4 sm:divide-x sm:divide-y-0" data-reveal-stagger>
